 ## Notes and limitations
 
+Standalone upscaling uses `-M upscale -i input.png --upscale-model model.safetensors -o output.png`.
+This mode does not load diffusion weights. ESRGAN weights with 12 input channels
+use pixel-unshuffle by 2 before the network's 4x upsampling, for an effective 2x
+output; weights with 48 input channels similarly produce effective 1x output.
+
 RGBA output retains its alpha channel during model upscaling and hires fix.
 The upscaler processes RGB; alpha is resized with bilinear interpolation and
 recombined with the result. The model architecture is detected from the weights.
